[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Problem
[?2004l[?2004h> Payment service ERROR logs were being dropped (not appearing in errors.log) while auth-service and inventory-service ERROR logs were processed correctly.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Root Cause
[?2004l[?2004h> The `classify_line()` function in filter.py had an overly broad check for "structured" logs:
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ```python
[?2004l[?2004h> if 'T' in line[:25] and ':' in line[:25]:
[?2004l[?2004h>     return 'structured'
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> This check was intended to identify structured/JSON logs but incorrectly matched ISO 8601 timestamps like `2024-01-15T08:48:40+00:00`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Why Only Payment Service Was Affected
[?2004l[?2004h> - **payment-svc**: Uses ISO 8601 timestamps: `2024-01-15T08:48:40+00:00 [ERROR] ...`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **auth-service**: Uses space-separated timestamps: `[ERROR] 2024-01-15 08:09:25 ...`
[?2004l[?2004h> - **inventory-service**: Uses space-separated timestamps: `[ERROR] 2024-01-15 08:30:16 ...`
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Payment-svc logs were misclassified as "structured" and routed to structured.log instead of being processed for severity-based routing to errors.log.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Solution
[?2004l[?2004h> Modified `classify_line()` to only identify actual JSON logs:
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ```python
[?2004l[?2004h> def classify_line(line):
[?2004l[?2004h>     # Check for actual JSON only
[?2004l[?2004h>     stripped = line.strip()
[?2004l[?2004h>     if stripped.startswith('{') and stripped.endswith('}'):
[?2004l[?2004h>         return 'structured'
[?2004l[?2004h>     return 'plaintext'
[?2004l[?2004h> ```
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Results
[?2004l[?2004h> - Before fix: 0 payment-svc ERROR logs in errors.log
[?2004l[?2004h> - After fix: 76 payment-svc ERROR logs correctly routed to errors.log
[?2004l[?2004h> - Other services: Still working correctly (23 auth-service, 28 inventory-service)
[?2004l[?2004h> - Structured logs: Still properly captured (5 JSON logs from metrics-collector)
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Files Modified
[?2004l[?2004h> - `/home/user/logpipe/filter.py` - Fixed classify_line() function
[?2004l[?2004h> - Backup created: `/home/user/logpipe/filter.py.backup`
[?2004l[?2004h> EOF
